# Start: the CLOUD hub, focus on BACK UP TO THE CLOUD. End: RESTORE FROM THE
# CLOUD's options page, focus on SAVES. Same rows and memory as the backup
# page, per direction. Since the cloud epic (#350, D-CLOUD-167) the press
# opens the scan page first and goes on to the options by itself; the
# settle waits that out. The fixture seeds /pixelelated/Saves so the scan
# does not stop at the offer to create the folder (vm-qa's ensure_fixture).
key down
wait-for-change
key x
wait-for-change
settle
shot restore-page
